  {
    "question": "圖中，弦 AB 與弦 CD 相交於 E。若 AE = 6 cm，EB = 4 cm 及 CE = 3 cm，求弦 CD 的長度。",
    "options": {
      "A": "8 cm",
      "B": "9 cm",
      "C": "10 cm",
      "D": "11 cm"
    },
    "correct_answer": "D",
    "explanation": "1. 根據相交弦定理 (Intersecting Chords Theorem)，圓內兩弦相交，其線段長度的積相等。\n2. 即 $AE \\times EB = CE \\times ED$。\n3. 代入數值：$6 \\times 4 = 3 \\times ED$。\n4. $24 = 3 \\times ED \\implies ED = 8 \\text{ cm}$。\n5. 弦 CD 的總長度 = $CE + ED = 3 + 8 = 11 \\text{ cm}$。",
